Id: aud005w
Severity: WARN
Category: logging
Check: check_accounting
Fix: Enable collection (ENABLED=true with a sysstat cron job or timer) or remove sysstat.
References: sar(1)
Controls: CIS 8.2, 8.5; NIST AU-2, AU-12; ISO 8.15

sysstat is installed but collects nothing: no data in two days,
so the system activity history an investigation wants (how loaded
the machine was, and when) is not there. Enable collection, or
remove sysstat if the history is not wanted.
